    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Can you expand on that a bit? Specifically, what are the warning signs that someone is about to transition from just being \"anxious\" or \"vocal\" to actually becoming a physical threat to the nurses or other patients? I want the training to really emphasize that moment where the mood shifts suddenly.",
